<title>USA: Jack Carl changes name to IFX Corp.</title>
<headline>Jack Carl changes name to IFX Corp.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Carl/312-Futures Inc said Monday it has changed its name to IFX Corp.</p>
<p>The change was required as part of the sale of the business of one of its subsidiaries, Index Futures Group Inc, to E.D.&amp; F. Man International Inc on July 1, 1996, IFX said.</p>
<p>IFX will maintain the stock symbol &quot;FUTR,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged at 1/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
